4FA5E&_nc_sid=8b3546", "username": "slayathomeplanners"}], "isPinned": true, "isCommentsDisabled": false}, {"id": "3954491491287909191", "type": "Video", "shortCode": "DbhLQ89hUNH", "caption": "A new season is coming our way, mamas - and we\u2019re mentally prepping for that shift.\n\nNew school schedules, sports, dinner menus, laundry demands, work obligations, less daylight \ud83d\ude06.\n\nEven the most prepared person can get overwhelmed by so many changes, especially after the beautiful bliss of summertime, sunshine, and flexibility \ud83e\udd70\ud83e\udef6\ud83e\udd79\n\nI have to remind myself at the start of every season that I don\u2019t have to have it all together, not everything has to get checked off my list, and I\u2019m doing JUST FINE \ud83d\ude05\ud83e\udd18.\n\nBut if you\u2019re needing some of these Home Reset Rules, too, they really help bring things back to perspective and keep you from burning out. Here they are again! \n\nMy Home Reset Rules:\n\nOne room at a time.\nTimer first.\nDone beats perfect.\nEvery item needs a home.\nStop before burnout.\n\nSave this post and share some of your reset rules with me below! \ud83d\udc47\ud83e\ude77\u2728\n\n#tidyspacetidymind #cleaning #cleanhome #cleanwithmemotivation #roomreset", "hashtags": ["tidyspacetidymind", "cleaning", "cleanhome", "cleanwithmemotivation", "roomreset"], "mentions": [], "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbhLQ89hUNH/", "commentsCount": 2, "dimensionsHeight": 1333, "dimensionsWidth": 750, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/762623848_18422830465178865_6576026313070703834_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHlc83ow-I3WlkhO0gVTuRziHlhcNzRwxTu3DHQrMFfHgOfFY9Dv5zfWcKDvI3FyFo&_nc_ohc=bmBc1eCD99EQ7kNvwF4fYxy&_nc_gid=CHOOIO9eGBr84XPy0B6DXA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQHAnTsuJtOw4QHuE08anKxsn5RX7WiufWhCUbjclGOhpA&oe=6A74ED0F&_nc_sid=8b3546", "images": [], "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNZOSajk-gUwDhG44ubnZEjefQmNz2S5yX0sVNB9BM26n1WYvCRyzWSowWV7c8ovmAQTFYks814phyx7xHuRXLJKhwRYrQCXxebbaU.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=bw392178OUkQ7kNvwGQSlmn&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTM1NDA2NjAwNjc5MzMyNiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjAsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoyNSwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=4f25f7fe14e5f1f2&_nc_&_nc_gid=CHOOIO9eGBr84XPy0B6DXA&_nc_ss=7a3ba&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQEF930IhxC0aIk0pP0CGF4NwyqtdSXBAPNkjtOk1xwnmg&oe=6A710B5A", "alt": null, "likesCount": 13, "videoViewCount": 440, "timestamp": "2026-08-02T00:55:06.000Z", "childPosts": [], "locationName": "Brighton, Michigan", "locationId": "215895908", "ownerUsername": "slayathomemother", "ownerId": "5511530864", "productType": "clips", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "Lowtone Music", "song_name": "Life Around Us", "uses_original_audio": false, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "1625296835223419"}, "isCommentsDisabled": false}, {"id": "3950867555925027126", "type": "Video", "shortCode": "DbUTRwJhuk2", "caption": "Pulled pork mini sandwiches for the win! Comment RECIPE \ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47 and I\u2019ll send you this one to copy/paste or screenshot \ud83e\udd70\n\nThis is one of my favorite low effort family dinner meal ideas because the crockpot basically does all the work for me. No special prep, thawing, for forethought going into this one. We make this any season, and pair it with whatever we\u2019re feeling like that day! \n\nHere\u2019s what you need:\n- half loin roast pork\n- 2 lemons \ud83c\udf4b \n- seasoning of your choice \n- BBQ sauce \n- Hawaiian rolls \n- crockpot \n\nDon\u2019t forgot to repurpose your lemon slices in a measuring cup or bowl of 2 cups of water and heat on HIGH for 5 minutes to help deep clean your microwave \ud83d\ude09 be careful as the water will be SUPER HOT. \ud83e\udd75 \n\nWhat\u2019s your favorite low-effort family meal? \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\n\n#familymeals #dinneridea #loweffortdinner #easyrecipes #easydinners", "hashtags": ["familymeals", "dinneridea", "loweffortdinner", "easyrecipes", "easydinners"], "mentions": [], "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbUTRwJhuk2/", "commentsCount": 3, "dimensionsHeight": 1333, "dimensionsWidth": 750, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/758368275_18422062990178865_7080504592451444956_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHlc83ow-I3WlkhO0gVTuRziHlhcNzRwxTu3DHQrMFfHgOfFY9Dv5zfWcKDvI3FyFo&_nc_ohc=ij8f99Kd--IQ7kNvwE61VUU&_nc_gid=CHOOIO9eGBr84XPy0B6DXA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQEcR2BhlWZEW35WEDbMAQlUPUC5UOyd2YJ0JleHc79NFQ&oe=6A74F2EE&_nc_sid=8b3546", "images": [], "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNWaaKrtJswlNaKIX9zI4d5Iw65GSXKCIYVisUF2Vr9zlRIIyAY89iuADGqLqhTpPHfIDjEefaUCtSDp_yk-clhLQb13VCUgm8g0gg.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=6N_L9W2LwPIQ7kNvwF9SELg&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTQ2MjA5ODY5OTI4MzkxNSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjUsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoyOSwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=ae1883bf7b130f9d&_nc_&_nc_gid=CHOOIO9eGBr84XPy0B6DXA&_nc_ss=7a3ba&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQGhYKRewB_RBTcGvYSkAxuKN-0bWHssucnuf-OuBGHchw&oe=6A711E04", "alt": null, "likesCount": 8, "videoViewCount": 215, "timestamp": "2026-07-28T00:40:31.000Z", "childPosts": [], "locationName": "Brighton, Michigan", "locationId": "215895908", "ownerUsername": "slayathomemother", "ownerId": "5511530864", "productType": "clips", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "Edith Whiskers", "song_name": "Home", "uses_original_audio": false, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "1191936897852538"}, "isCommentsDisabled": false}, {"id": "3950140197370728146", "type": "Video", "shortCode": "DbRt5StRg7S", "caption": "Comment LASER and I\u2019ll send you the deets! \ud83d\udd17 \ud83d\ude0d\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\n\nI made my own custom car emblem using acrylic, my laser, and some 3M tape. \n\nThis is my third time making one for our cars, and they stay put through car washes, rain, wind, hail \ud83d\ude06, wildfire smoke, all the Midwest adventures we go on, you name it. My husband\u2019s has been on his car for two years now, my previous car had one on for 2.5 years, now it was time for decorate my new car :). \n\n They hold up great and are so fun to make! \n\nLaser: @thunderlaserusa Nova Plus [thunderlaserpartner]\nMaterial: 2 layers of 1/8\u201d acrylic + double-sided 3M tape \n\nBe sure to clean your flat surface really well and apply pressure for a couple minutes. I would also avoid washing directly/rain for about 48 hours \ud83d\ude09 if that wasn\u2019t obvious! \ud83e\udef6\n\nHave you tried making one of these? \ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\n\n#crafts #laserengraved #lasercraft #caremblems #craftingisfun", "hashtags": ["crafts", "laserengraved", "lasercraft", "caremblems", "craftingisfun"], "mentions": ["thunderlaserusa"], "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbRt5StRg7S/", "commentsCount": 5, "dimensionsHeight": 1920, "dimensionsWidth": 1080, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/758678145_18421903585178865_6280432690267064796_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHlc83ow-I3WlkhO0gVTuRziHlhcNzRwxTu3DHQrMFfHgOfFY9Dv5zfWcKDvI3FyFo&_nc_ohc=LtgUKUPNG2cQ7kNvwEBtrha&_nc_gid=CHOOIO9eGBr84XPy0B6DXA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQEOomKDYhI56kHiGZ0nl-ddz7zhbgOiLi3oXT3W7Ql7Og&oe=6A74EBB7&_nc_sid=8b3546", "images": [], "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQP