ace. If you even need them \ud83e\udd37\u200d\u2640\ufe0f \n\nIn this case - I definitely did \ud83d\ude06\ud83e\udee3 but my old setup wasn\u2019t working (it wasn\u2019t the giant stack shown in this video, but it wasn\u2019t working, so I ditched the system I was using for the giant stack \ud83d\ude01). \n\nAnd that\u2019s the cycle\u2026\n\nTry one system \u2014> \nrealize it doesn\u2019t fit your needs so you ditch it \u2014> \nend up with a giant stack or pile \u2014> \nfigure out something that actually DOES work for your space and needs. \ud83e\udef0 \n\nI knew I wanted four containers, preferably different colors (for easy sorting and organizing for both me and the kids) and I needed them much wider than the 2\u201d vertical containers I was using. \n\nThose would be able to hold one, maybe two books - nothing more \ud83d\ude15\n\nThis works so much better for us, and while it might not be as beige or clear as someone else\u2019s homeschool setup - it works \ud83d\udc4f. And that\u2019s the real goal in home organization, am I right? \n\nSkip what everyone else thinks would or should work. Measure your workbooks (or items!) and find containers that fit around the measurements you need. \n\n#homeorganizer #organized #homeschool #homeschoolroom #organizedhouse", "hashtags": ["homeorganizer", "organized", "homeschool", "homeschoolroom", "organizedhouse"], "mentions": [], "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dal5oA6gT9Y/", "commentsCount": 95, "dimensionsHeight": 1333, "dimensionsWidth": 750, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/743967210_18419184082178865_5033614684946361911_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHlc83ow-I3WlkhO0gVTuRziHlhcNzRwxTu3DHQrMFfHgOfFY9Dv5zfWcKDvI3FyFo&_nc_ohc=mH6rX8Vs7CYQ7kNvwHnvmhq&_nc_gid=CHOOIO9eGBr84XPy0B6DXA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQFgC6UgZGThbIZ5uqmyH36Qa10-WA4Du_ch8ku_8DNDEA&oe=6A7517BB&_nc_sid=8b3546", "images": [], "videoUrl": "https