2910353476558_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e0_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby41MDAuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHlc83ow-I3WlkhO0gVTuRziHlhcNzRwxTu3DHQrMFfHgOfFY9Dv5zfWcKDvI3FyFo&_nc_ohc=dJ5sHusSQLMQ7kNvwFRgXKo&_nc_gid=CHOOIO9eGBr84XPy0B6DXA&edm=AOQ1c0wBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQH06sAixaaWn4g7648-43Bzwptywm4igW-4vb_WApAEyQ&oe=6A750256&_nc_sid=8b3546", "username": "thunderlaserusa"}], "isCommentsDisabled": false}, {"id": "3926943013309474748", "type": "Video", "shortCode": "DZ_Td1hg2e8", "caption": "Homeschool curriculum choices for the upcoming school year \ud83d\ude4f\ud83e\udef6 \n\nPlease note that I will not be debating anyone on the different curriculums, this will be our second year so I\u2019m far from an expert on that. \ud83d\ude01\n\nHere\u2019s what we chose:\n- @thegoodandthebeautiful math and language arts/handwriting\n- @masterbooks soil, sea, and sky elementary science pack \n- @notgrasshistory Our 50 States pack \n- TGTB U.S. Constitution & Government bundle \n- @notconsumed daily apologetics Faithipedias (old & new testaments) \n- Google Sheets planner \n\nI say all this knowing life happens and we\u2019ll have sick days, play dates, a co-op \ud83d\ude4f , Awana, field trips - not everything will go according to plan \ud83d\ude06\ud83e\udee3 but us #homeschoolmoms can try, right? \ud83d\ude01 \n\nAnd by mapping things out, I can get a better sense of what\u2019s to come \ud83e\udd70\n\nI think Icame into the first year not nearly as organized and prepped as I found out I needed to be so I *could* pivot - but now I\u2019ve got my feet on more solid ground \ud83d\udcaa", "hashtags": ["homeschoolmoms"], "mentions": ["thegoodandthebeautiful", "masterbooks", "notgrasshistory", "notconsumed"], "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DZ_Td1hg2e8/", "commentsCount": 4, "dimensionsHeight": 1333, "dimensionsWidth": 750, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/730779685_184167